        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791540/extras/f9fcf468c2caa489c81d7b28ea9a66a7.avif?t=1759142590\" width=731 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astro Felix</strong> is a fast paced endless skate adventure where you play as Felix, the universe’s coolest cat on four wheels! Dash through the vibrant cyber city, dodge deadly obstacles, outsmart  enemies, and collect coins and power-ups to boost your run. This platformer will test your reflexes and charm your heart.  <br>  <br><strong>From Home Cat to Pixel Hero</strong>  <br>Astro Felix started as an experimental passion project based on a real cat, our beloved real life companion! His quirky behavior, skate-like slides across the floor, and curious nature inspired us to turn him into a pixel legend.   <br> <br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast-paced 2D gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cute and quirky space cat protagonist (Yes actually based on our real life cat.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Avoid enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect coins and powerful pickups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gamepad and keyboard support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pure arcade fun with a unique twist </p></li></ul>",
